      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="introduction">
        <tei:p>This piece is about Ḥanina ben Dosa, a wonder-working rabbi who lived in Judea in the first century. The singer pleads to Ḥanina that he intercede on Israel’s behalf and obtain God’s help and salvation for her and the world.</tei:p>
        <tei:p>I wrote this song in Late Classical Hebrew save for one stanza in Judeo-Aramaic.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
      <j:endConditional target="#osp_47956_introduction"/>
